arXiv:1311.3899 (Grohe–Kreutzer–Siebertz, "Deciding first-order properties
of nowhere dense graphs"; JACM 2017) LaTeX source, fetched 2026-08-17.

**License differs from the other references here.** This one is under
arXiv's default non-exclusive distribution license, not CC-BY 4.0. It is
checked in on Jan's explicit permission, 2026-08-17, because both audits
of the ND-MC algorithm redesign had to run without it: every claim traced
to "GKS §6" or "GKS §8" in `plans/nowhere-dense-model-checking/` had been
checked against absence rather than against text, and §6 (sparse
neighborhood covers) is the one routine the whole running-time argument
rests on.

